# TrackSense AI - frontend environment
#
# OPTIONAL. With no .env file the app talks to http://127.0.0.1:8000, which is
# where the backend runs by default. You only need this when the backend is
# somewhere else.
#
# To use it: copy this file to `.env` in the same folder.
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# Vite only exposes variables that start with VITE_, and it reads them at build
# time - restart `npm run dev` after changing this.

# Base URL of the TrackSense backend. No trailing slash.
# Local:      http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Deployed:   https://<your-username>-tracksense.hf.space
# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
